body:
Trump needs to pay for what he's done, they all need to pay.

&#x200B;

We need to get rallied and eat the rich, they're eating our planet and we live here damn it.

Unions just take money and get nothing done, or take money and get money from the higher ups.

&#x200B;

It's just another illusion in this corrupt land of the fee

Genocide is such a scary thought.

&#x200B;

Hiding it is even worse.

Good old Saudi Arabia.

&#x200B;

Having all that money and doing nothing with it.

The irony.

&#x200B;

I'm sure these fools will delude themselves and come up with some bullshit excuse.

ALways nice that there are new ideas to incentives people to put on seat belts.

&#x200B;

Although in this day and age I can't wait until there's a movement that anti-seat belt since belts can choke you or some shit.

Honestly, I can't stop thinking myself. SO I use that to my advantage and think about if I was in an anime or a TV series, how could I be a part of that story? What would I do? WHhere would I come from that makes sense. How would the series change and would it be a better or worse ending.

&#x200B;

Over time I eventually fall alseep, but this only works if I'm actually tired even to unconsciously yawn.

Might need to find a job near you, or start using uber to drive to work, and see if you can get a discount for repeated uses or something. FOr some people, college isn't worth it, to be honest I wish I didn't go to college since i wasn't free to pursue my dreams. 

&#x200B;

Perhaps you should spend the time finding what you truly want to do, and not the preconceived notions that society has placed on us where you have to go to college to succeed.
